6 Highlighted Provisions:
7 This bill:
8 ▸ requires a county jail to assist certain county jail inmates in obtaining a current driver license or
state-issued identification;
1 0 ▸ requires a substance abuse treatment program to provide the results of a participant's drug test to
the participant's supervising probation or parole officer under certain conditions;
1 2 ▸ requires the Driver License Division to coordinate with a county jail in providing a county
inmate with a driver license certificate or a temporary regular identification card;
1 4 ▸ requires the Department of Corrections (department) to:
1 5 identify and provide information and resources regarding post-incarceration housing;
