Section 53-3-214; or
74 (b)
(i) extend the county inmate's state-issued regular identification card, as described in Section 53-3-807;
or
76 (ii) issue the county inmate a temporary regular identification card as described in Subsection
53-3-805(11), unless the county inmate plans to live outside this state immediately upon release.
