640 (i) comply with the notice requirement to a prosecuting agency described in Subsection 77-38-3(6) if
the division is the moving party on a motion for modification of any determination made at any of
the criminal justice hearings provided in Subsections 77-38-2(5)(a) through (g);
644 (j) collect restitution information in preparing a presentence investigation report as described in Section
77-38b-203;
